{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2885","title":"Creating a Connected Future – Xiaomi Introduces People-centric Innovation Philosophy at MWC 2023","desc":"From February 28th to March 1st, 2023, Xiaomi exhibits its newest technological advancements and vision for a connected future at MWC Barcelona 2023. ","view_cnt":"3370","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1677765766","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i01.appmifile.com/webfile/globalimg/PR/Connected_Future_MWC_2023.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003eFrom February 28th to March 1st, 2023, Xiaomi exhibits its newest technological advancements and vision for a connected future at MWC Barcelona 2023. Through various zones that showcase its latest flagship products and smart living scenarios, Xiaomi is offering visitors a firsthand look at its comprehensive product portfolio covering an extensive array of over 150 innovative products. This immersive experience provides insight into Xiaomi's innovative approach to utilizing technology to enhance daily life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/549_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/02/03/2023/528d82dcfbc437fc462758288a280e34.jpg\"\u003eAt the booth, spotlights shine on the Xiaomi Wireless AR Glass Discovery Edition, the newly launched Xiaomi 13 Series, Xiaomi 12S Ultra, and the latest AIoT products designed to enhance smart connected living. In addition, CyberOne is sure to captivate and impress audiences with its advanced humanoid robot capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"At Xiaomi, we strongly believe that connectivity is the crucial driving force behind innovation. Our commitment to enhancing people's lives through pioneering technology, our Xiaomi InSight imaging philosophy, and a diverse portfolio of Smart Living products is unwavering. Through continuous investment in research and development, our goal is to lead innovations not just within the smartphone industry but also beyond it, toward a more connected and sustainable world.\" Xiaomi's spokesperson stated, \"We hope our visitors at the MWC booth gain insight into how Xiaomi has turned groundbreaking concepts into reality, challenging and reshaping expectations for the future.”\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePioneering technology inspired by life, for life\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt MWC, Xiaomi presents its engineers' look into the advanced future by delving deeper into Xiaomi's first-ever wireless AR glasses to utilize distributed computing, offering a retina-level near-eye display nearly matching the sharpness of human vision and a well-thought-out AR interface, Xiaomi AR Gesture Control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/123_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/02/03/2023/aed7f942e1514ca403e4a91003d45a3a.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, the CyberOne humanoid robot, developed by Xiaomi's Robotics Lab, is a testament to Xiaomi's commitment to fostering a technological ecosystem focused on a single point while also connecting it with the world in unprecedented ways.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi's 5G DSDA(Dual-SIM Dual-Active) is a new mobile device solution that enables simultaneous use of up to two 5G+5G or 5G+4G SIM cards to secure smart, flexible, and seamless connectivity for users at all times.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi InSight: State-of-the-art imaging quality\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a mission to be the coolest company in users' hearts, Xiaomi is pushing the boundaries of what is possible with advanced imaging technology. At MWC Barcelona, visitors are greeted with Xiaomi 13 Series at the entrance of the spacious showroom, featuring a Leica co-engineered camera system that delivers stunning professional quality images that are beyond human perception.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi has also been developing its own imaging technology, Xiaomi Imaging Engine, a proprietary software-based technology that optimizes image quality through a series of computational processes. With tuning functions including multi-frame compositing, noise reduction, and white balance calibration, the imaging algorithm ensures that every image captured is authentic, natural, and of the highest quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity, simplicity, and sustainability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi welcomes visitors to its showroom exhibition at MWC Barcelona, where they can experience the company's Smart Living philosophy through a range of products that cover various aspects of life, including Smart Home Cinema, Smart Living Room, Smart Workspace, Smart Kitchen, and Smart Outdoors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/925_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/02/03/2023/d836fcfa01a1c1ff9d87625be6926a52.jpg\"\u003eIn the Smart Living Room zone, visitors discover home appliances and products such as the Mi TV Q1 75\" with its stunning QLED display and the Xiaomi Smart Air Purifier Elite which effectively eliminates smells, dust, and allergens. These products offer users easy access to spectacular entertainment and quality of life.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmart Outdoors showcases the latest Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Ultra, emphasizing the company's dedication to providing eco-friendly transportation solutions that make commuting more convenient and sustainable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith an AIoT system that connects over 558 million smart devices, Xiaomi is dedicated to creating a connected and efficient lifestyle. In addition, by adopting greener materials and promoting greener ways of life, Xiaomi is deeply invested in making this lifestyle more sustainable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePartnership for global connectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is expanding its connected future through enhanced partnerships. Together with Deutsche Telekom, Xiaomi is now providing an unparalleled user experience to its smart TV customers in Germany. This collaboration ensures that MagentaTV by Deutsche Telekom to be the most easily accessible platform for Xiaomi's Android-based TV range in Germany.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Group relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. According to Canalys, the Group’s market share in terms of smartphone shipments ranked No. 3 globally in the third quarter of 2022. The Group has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 558 million smart devices connected to its platform as of September 30, 2022, excluding smartphones, tablets and laptops. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2022, the Group made the Fortune Global 500 list for the fourth time, ranking #266, up 72 places compared to 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003eFor more information about Xiaomi as a company, please visit \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"172","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1677740638"},"common":null}